{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1162016-meghan-morzz-or-johnn-jonz-which-is-the-huntsman","id":1162016,"title":"Meghan Morzz or Johnn jonz.. which is the huntsman?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-23T17:21:59-08:00","id":1162016,"title":"Meghan Morzz or Johnn jonz.. which is the huntsman?","content":"I apologize that autocorrect and voice chat make this very difficult to ask, but I know for a fact that at the very least most of the game developers as well as players have at least a basic knowledge about the DC Universe. I've been running a dc-based role playing game for... Most of my life, actually. It's had to go from Old World Of Darkness to New World of darkness and there have been many changes involved.<br /> <br /> But something that I really would love for some of you guys too give some input on, that I've asked before, is about the Huntsman. Considering the idea that he is literally named The Martian Manhunter, is Jon Jones a Huntsman hunting Megan? Or is it the other way around?<br /> <br /> I would be considerably more eloquence about this question, if it weren't for the fact that I have to deal with auto correct and everything like that. But I also don't know that much about the Huntsman, and I genuinely would like to hear Rose or Meghan give their opinion on this matter. I'm still not sure about how to portray this situation, especially since it involves translating one character from one medium to another. But, I think it's also a perfect opportunity for them to express exactly what a huntsman means. After all, we all know that they are shapeshifters. We all know that they can sneak up behind you, metaphorically, and that you might never see them coming. And thus far, since changeling second edition has not yet been released, I have been trying to blur the lines considerably. Thus far, none of my players know which of them is a changeling and which of them is a husband. So, I asked Rose and Megan, which would you make the Huntsman? The one literally named The Martian Manhunter? Or the one who is apparently part of a violent race who is oppressing the other? Which of them fits the themes of 2nd edition change link better, to make one and the other not? Or are they both just privateers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}